#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:5
#: 8abdce27ad9f463c872382fa91378a93
msgid "DriveCalculator Motor and Prop Efficiency Guide"
msgstr "DriveCalculator 电机和螺旋桨效率指南"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:7
#: 2abe0c1f7d39452fa29baa9aeea5ea15
msgid ""
"`Drive Calculator <http://www.drivecalc.de>`__ is a free tool for brushless "
"motor power system analysis and prop/motor selection. It has a large and "
"growing database of motors, propellers, escs, and batteries. You can test "
"combinations to get an estimate of maximum current, efficiency, prop speed, "
"etc. It is available for Windows, MAC, and Linux."
msgstr ""
"`Drive Calculator <http://www.drivecalc.de>`__ "
"是一款用于无刷电机动力系统分析及螺旋桨/电机选型的免费工具。它拥有庞大且持续增长的电机、螺旋桨、ESC "
"和电池数据库。您可以测试各种组合以估算最大电流、效率、螺旋桨转速等。支持 Windows、MAC 和 Linux 平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:9
#: 673a81aebe5c4ec9a04ec0799a7cb152
msgid ""
"The screenshot below illustrates its interface and use. In this example, it "
"shows an analysis of one of the motors used in the :ref:`MiniTalon Build "
"example<miniTalon-build>`."
msgstr ""
"下面的截图展示了其界面和使用方法。在此示例中，显示了对 :ref:`MiniTalon 构建示例<miniTalon-build>` "
"中所用电机之一的分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:17
#: 7ec421909b434cc0993f9b8aafb69b18
msgid "Entering the information"
msgstr "输入信息"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:19
#: 2a60b9b8d9884860af8f7e1dc37d12ba
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"After opening the application, you can select {1} the exact battery to be "
"used,or the voltage to run the analysis, {2} the motor from a large database"
" of motors/test data, and {3} the propeller to be used, again from a large "
"database included. You can also change the ESC used {4}, although it will "
"only make a minor difference in the analysis. It is shown, since that ESC "
"was used to gather the motor test data entered into the database."
msgstr ""
"打开应用程序后，您可以选择 {1} 要使用的具体电池或运行分析的电压，{2} 从庞大的电机/测试数据数据库中选择电机，以及 {3} "
"要使用的螺旋桨，同样来自内置的大型数据库。您也可以更改所用的 ESC {4}，虽然这对分析结果的影响很小。显示它是因为该 ESC "
"被用于收集输入数据库的电机测试数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:22
#: f12e7d528c9643678136e8934cc31ae9
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:24
#: 3fd79d275d0b4151bb3b739391f7262f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Instantly, the full throttle analysis will appear. {5} is the current at "
"full throttle, {6} shows curves of efficiency versus throttle for the motor "
"with that voltage source/battery. Static thrust and static propeller speed "
"are shown in {7}. By scrolling through propellers in the list, you can "
"instantly see the effects on the results. Likewise, you can choose and "
"\"HOLD\" a voltage/battery, and/or propeller, and see the results as you "
"scroll through motors in the database. You can also search for a motor's KV,"
" weight, etc. and restrict the motors list to scroll through to only match "
"those criteria."
msgstr ""
"全油门分析结果将立即显示。{5} 为全油门时的电流，{6} 显示该电压源/电池下电机效率与油门的曲线关系。静态推力和静态螺旋桨转速显示在 {7} "
"中。通过在列表中滚动选择螺旋桨，可以立即看到对结果的影响。同样，您可以选择并「锁定」某个电压/电池和/或螺旋桨，然后在数据库中滚动选择电机查看结果。您还可以按电机"
" KV 值、重量等搜索，并将电机列表限制为仅匹配这些条件的型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/drivecalculator-guide.rst:27
#: 93531d79f0c44fa1b2cc4cf4b40dc72c
msgid ""
"While not exact, due to component variations, etc. the results are very "
"close to actual."
msgstr "由于元件差异等因素，结果并非精确，但与实际值非常接近。"
